  "description": "A modernized and patched implementation of the MechCommander 2 real-time tactics game engine, originally released by Microsoft. The codebase features a custom 3D rendering pipeline using the Tiny Geometry Layer (TGL), quad-tree based terrain management, and a specialized mission scripting system (ABL). It provides comprehensive tooling including a mission editor and asset management utilities for large-scale tactical simulations.",
